    "sections": [
      {
        "kind": "definition",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Interest targeting delivers ads to people based on their higher interaction with certain interests, such as gaming.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "**Interests:** Deliver to people based on their higher interaction with certain interests. For example, gaming.",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Interests is one of the dimensions under TikTok's Advanced Targeting, alongside purchase intent, behaviors and hashtags.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "Advanced Targeting",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Interest targeting is configured at the ad group level during the campaign creation process.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "Available targeting locations will vary by market",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "The emphasis on 'higher interaction' means interests signal attention and engagement, not a verified intent to buy — a distinction marketers should keep when planning budgets.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "TikTok identifies users whose engagement with an interest category is higher than average and restricts delivery to those people when the interest is selected.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Smart targeting can expand beyond your interest selections when delivery based on your initial targeting is predicted to be hard, so an interest-restricted audience is not guaranteed to stay restricted.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "Smart Interest and Behavior and Smart Audiences",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "TikTok can recommend interests and behaviors to use while you build an ad group, based on industry and account performance.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "Targeting recommendations",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Reach people with consistently high engagement in a broad category (the documentation's own example is gaming) to build awareness with a receptive audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "For example, gaming",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Use it when your category maps to a well-defined TikTok interest area and you want delivery concentrated on people who already engage with that content type.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when you need people actively researching or purchasing a product category — the platform offers a separate purchase intent dimension for that, and interest targeting alone does not distinguish ready buyers from engaged viewers.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "Purchase intent: Deliver to people who are actively researching or purchasing one specific category",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when your delivery must stay inside the selected interest audience, because smart targeting may extend beyond your designated audience settings.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.paid_social.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/ad-targeting?lang=en",
                "locator": "Smart Interest and Behavior and Smart Audiences",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Ad targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
